Package: ai-reader
Version: 2.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: AI Reader Team <dev@ai-reader.io>
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-pango-1.0, libgtk-3-0, libc6, libstdc++6
Homepage: https://github.com/ai-reader/ai-reader
Description: Editorial Minimalist AI Reader with iA Writer Margins & NLP Knowledge Graph
 AI Reader is a modern editorial reading workbench supporting EPUB, PDF,
 Markdown, and TXT with iA Writer baseline-aligned marginalia, 4 deep cognitive
 companion templates, offline classical NLP keyword extraction, co-occurrence
 graphs, and structured interactive mind maps.
